  [PASS] P1f [dust collapse] with T_00 = rho, T_ii = p: 2 Delta Psi = 8 pi G rho and 2 Delta(Phi-Psi) = 8 pi G (3 p); for p = 0 with Phi-Psi -> 0 at infinity, Phi = Psi
         measured: Delta Psi = 4 pi G rho ; Delta(Phi-Psi) = 12 pi G p  (dust: p=0, homogeneous)
